* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-PerfectSoundWhatever-deoxyribonucleic acid.wav|a=CA}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|biochemistry|genetics}} A [[nucleic acid]] [[find#Verb|found]] in all [[living thing]]s (and some [[non-living]] things such as certain [[virus#Noun|viruses]]) which [[consist#Verb|consists]] of [[two]] [[polynucleotide]] [[chain#Noun|chains]] that [[coil#Verb|coil]] around each other to [[form#Verb|form]] a [[double helix]]; [[encode#Verb|encoded]] in its [[structure#Noun|structure]] are [[genetic]] [[instruction]]s for [[development]], [[functioning#Noun|functioning]], [[growth]], and [[reproduction]].
#: {{syn|en|deoxyribose nucleic acid|desoxyribose nucleic acid|double helix|q4=abbreviation|DNA}}
#: {{mer|en|nucleotide}}

